          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: વિચિત્ર",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "વિચિત્ર — vicitra — \"strange; odd\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "મારા કાકાને વિચિત્ર ટેવ છે. mārā kākāne vicitra ṭev che. My uncle has an odd habit."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "વિચિત્ર (vicitra) is a tatsama, Sanskrit vicitra, \"variegated, many-coloured\", as Monier-Williams records it; Gujarati uses it for anything out of the ordinary."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
